---
title: Agent Run Lifecycle
---
stateDiagram-v2
    %% Supported subset: pseudo-states, guards, aliases, choice, notes.
    [*] --> Queued
    Queued --> Planning: request accepted
    state "Executing tools" as Executing
    Planning --> Executing
    Executing --> Reviewing
    state Reviewing <<choice>>
    Reviewing --> Completed: gate passed
    Reviewing --> Failed: gate rejected
    Failed --> Executing: retry budget
    Executing --> Blocked: missing input
    Blocked --> Cancelled: operator stopped
    Completed --> [*]
    Cancelled --> [*]
    note right of Blocked
        waits for user input
    end note
